hifiberry-webui (0.19.10) stable; urgency=medium

  * Setup wizard: when the user accepts the autodetected card, pin it
    the same way a manual selection does (writes both the dtoverlay
    and the `# HiFiBerry card:` comment via
    /api/v1/soundcard/detection/disable). Previously this path only
    cleared the pin, which left config.txt without a HiFiBerry
    dtoverlay — on Beocreate-class hardware the kernel then didn't
    load the audio driver at next boot and config-detect couldn't
    recover.

